{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439990/extras/Wishlist_Banner.gif?t=1744638068\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439990/extras/Wishlist_Banner.gif?t=1744638068\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439990/extras/Wishlist_Banner.gif?t=1744638068\" />Blast off into the infinite universe!<br>&quot;Rocket Penguin&quot; is a unique 2D flying game that may seem simple but requires master-level skills to reach outer space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439990/extras/BannerWord_story_ENG.png?t=1744638068\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As an orphan bird that cannot fly, the penguin protagonist Peeo has always envied those who can soar freely through the sky. One day, by a twist of fate, he acquires a unique rocket engine and, henceforth, embarks on a bizarre adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439990/extras/ExpeditionPanel.png?t=1744638068\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439990/extras/BannerWord_gameFeature_ENG.png?t=1744638068\" /></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A quirky rocket flight \u2013 just two buttons, and it actually works!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Endless altitude expedition mode: strive to break through the atmosphere, challenge the world rankings, or test your limits!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every crash brings you closer to mastering the art of flight.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">20+ story levels filled with unique challenges, from eating contests and speed races to cargo delivery and even soccer matches!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize your look and upgrade your rocket!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Meet penguins of all shapes and sizes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Local split-screen PvP \u2013 battle your friends or crash into chaos together!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439990/extras/Image_Beach.png?t=1744638068\" /> <br><strong>Collect all the rockets!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each rocket comes with unique specs and abilities, with over 10 different rockets to pilot! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439990/extras/RocketSkill.gif?t=1744638068\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"> <strong>Meet the penguins!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Throughout your journey, you'll meet a variety of penguins. Who will be your trusty ally, and who will try to sabotage you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439990/extras/char.gif?t=1744638068\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439990/extras/mainPage.png?t=1744638068\" /><i><strong>&quot;A bizarre rocket adventure \u2014 can you blast off to the universe?&quot;</strong></i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2439990?t=1744638068","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439990/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1744638068","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439990/7475f2ded8baabbd2b056b802975ca884aa7daf2/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744638068","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439990/7475f2ded8baabbd2b056b802975ca884aa7daf2/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744638068","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3392890,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439990/extras/Wishlist_Banner.gif?t=1744638068\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439990/extras/Wishlist_Banner.gif?t=1744638068\" /><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439990/extras/Wishlist_Banner.gif?t=1744638068\" />Blast off into the infinite universe!<br>&quot;Rocket Penguin&quot; is a unique 2D flying game that may seem simple but requires master-level skills to reach outer space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439990/extras/BannerWord_story_ENG.png?t=1744638068\" /></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As an orphan bird that cannot fly, the penguin protagonist Peeo has always envied those who can soar freely through the sky. One day, by a twist of fate, he acquires a unique rocket engine and, henceforth, embarks on a bizarre adventure!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2439990/extras/Expe